  "about": "Feature value parity between the web app and the training code (PB-13 to PB-15; monthly income since PB-58). Each applicant uses the web app's stored field names. expected_features were worked out by hand from the PB-12 definitions, with annual income = monthly income x 12 (loan_to_income = amount / annual income; repayment_burden = (amount / tenure) / (annual income / 12); dti = monthly debt repayments / (annual income / 12) x 100), rounded to 10 decimal places. Both web/tests/Unit/RiskFeaturesTest.php (RiskFeatures::for) and risk-service/tests/test_feature_parity.py (ml.dataset.platform_features) must reproduce them within the tolerance.",
